				"count": 14.0,
				"damage": 15.0,
				"formula": "# Candy's ring: it closes in on the middle and opens out past the corners\n# every 4 beats, turning as it goes. Slip through a gap as it passes\n# (near the walls the gaps are widest) and graze for TP\ninner = 6\nouter = 120\nbreathe = 0.5 + 0.5 * cos(t * pi / 2)\nradius = inner + (outer - inner) * breathe\na = u * tau + t * 0.3\nx = radius * cos(a)\ny = radius * sin(a)\nsize = 9\nalpha = min(t, 1)\nhue = 0.85\nsat = 0.3\nval = 1\n",
